SUMMARY:Wine\, Live Music & Food Truck
DESCRIPTION:🌮🎷 Live Music & Food Truck Night at Great Bear Vineyards 🎷🍷\nFriday\, May 1 | 5–8pm\nTicket Includes: Glass of Wine & Live Music\nKick off your weekend with smooth jazz\, incredible tacos\, and vineyard vibes at Great Bear! ✨\n🎷 The Potential Jazz Ensemble will be setting the tone from 6–7:30pm with a vibrant\, soulful performance. This talented group blends classic jazz roots with fresh\, creative energy—featuring saxophone\, bass\, guitar\, piano\, and drums for a rich\, dynamic sound you won’t want to miss.\n🌮 Come hungry! Maiz Mexican Food will be onsite from 5–8pm\, serving up authentic\, family-made Mexican favorites—from tacos and quesadillas to huaraches\, all packed with bold flavor and signature smoked meats.\nYour ticket includes a glass of wine\, with more available by the glass or bottle as you relax\, sip\, and soak in the sounds of the evening.\n✨ Food Truck: 5–8pm\n🎶 Live Music: 6–7:30pm\nGreat music\, delicious food\, and a beautiful vineyard setting—the perfect recipe for a Friday night. Grab your friends and join us! \n  \n 
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/wine-live-music-food-truck/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards (Great Bear)\, 24800 County Rd 101A
